Borrowed "0..9999" -- "0..9999" Retro_Projetor : Books_Borrowed
Reserved "0..9999" -- "0..9999" Retro_Projetor : Books_Reserved
Borrowed "0..9999" -- "0..9999" Members : Borrowed_Member
Ar_Condicionado "0..9999" -- "1..1" Members : Fine_Member
Quado_Branco "0..9999" -- "0..9999" Retro_Projetor : Librarian_Books
Ar_Condicionado "0..9999" -- "0..9999" Quado_Branco : Librarian_Fine
Members "0..9999" -- "0..9999" Quado_Branco : Member_Librarian
